cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SurvivalML: machine learning for survival analysis of oral carcinoma"
abstract: >-
  Code of a bachelor's thesis that compares Random Survival Forest, XGBoost
  Survival Embeddings and DeepSurv on the TCGA-HNSC cohort, with a
  leakage-free preprocessing and evaluation protocol and explanations based
  on permutation importance and SHAP.
authors:
